DreamResponsiveBehaviour {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Interaction/DreamResponsiveBinding.h#DreamResponsiveBehaviour
    src   "Applies the first matching breakpoint using the parent size (or self size at the root).\n\nThe rules are OVERRIDES on the appearance the widget was authored with, not a complete\ndescription of it: a size that matches no rule puts the widget back the way it was found rather\nthan leaving it wearing the last rule's costume. See EvaluateResponsiveRules for why that is the\nchosen answer and what the baseline it restores actually is."
    text  "使用父项尺寸（根节点处使用自身尺寸）应用第一个匹配的断点。\n\n这些规则是对控件创作时外观的覆盖，而非对该外观的完整\n描述：未匹配任何规则的尺寸会将控件恢复为发现它时的状态，而不是\n让它继续套用上一条规则的外观。有关为何这是\n所选答案以及它恢复的基线实际是什么，请参见 EvaluateResponsiveRules。"
    state machine
}

